   - Wait 15-30 minutes for permission propagation

C. Test in Outlook Directly:
   - Create new email manually
   - Try changing "From" field to secondary email
   - If this doesn't work, permissions aren't set

D. Alternative - Use Actual Account:
   - Add secondary email as separate Outlook account
   - Tool will use SendUsingAccount method instead

